  "tip": "**থেকে** 'from' pairs with **পর্যন্ত** (*porjonto*) 'to / as far as': **ঢাকা থেকে সিলেট পর্যন্ত** 'from Dhaka to Sylhet'.\n\nThe future of 'go' by person: **যাব** (I/we), **যাবে** (তুমি, সে), **যাবেন** (আপনি, তিনি). The yes/no **কি** sits after the subject: **এই বাস কি ঢাকা যাবে?** 'Does this bus go to Dhaka?' (lit. 'will go').\n\n'By bus / by train' uses the locative: **বাসে**, **ট্রেনে**.\n\nTrains leave (**ছাড়বে**, 'will leave') from Dhaka's Kamalapur and Airport stations; buy your **টিকিট** early before Eid, when everyone travels home.",
